      "content": "Thanks, that level of granularity is exactly what I'm looking for. You were starting to list examples—could you finish that? Specifically, how would you differentiate between a case where a signature is clearly there but just illegible/worn (an \"untraceable\" identity) versus a case where there's absolutely no indication of a person at all? It feels like there's a qualitative difference between a \"hidden\" creator and a \"missing\" one.",
